      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'To start with something simple.

    To the right of the hotel you will
    find a guarded passage, behind which is a small square, with an alley on the
    opposite side. There you will find a package with parts that will enable you
    to assemble something.... Useful. Go get them, when you claim them you will find
    out what to do next.

    Don''t waste your time on foolishness.

    Agamemnon'
